# Deploy Sincla

Detalhes completos: `.gemini/workflows/processos-de-deploy.md`

## Remotes do monorepo (raiz)

| Comando | Remote | Repo GitHub | Easypanel |
|---------|--------|-------------|-----------|
| `git push origin main` | origin | sincla-hub | apps/sincla-app (`/app`) |
| `git push site main` | site | sincla-site | apps/site-sincla (`/site`) |

## Tools (repo independente em cada pasta)

| Pasta | Repo | Easypanel |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `tools/agenda/` | sincla-agenda | apps/sincla-agenda |
| `tools/rh/` | sincla-rh | apps/sincla-rh |
| `tools/bolso/` | sincla-bolso | apps/sincla-bolso |
| `tools/ead/` | sincla-ead | apps/sincla-ead |
| `tools/vagas/` | sincla-talento | apps/sincla-talento |

Variáveis de produção ficam no Easypanel, não no `.env` local.
